. * 2. A small network with a known group structure: Sampson's monks
. nwwebuse sampson, nwclear

. list in 1/6

     +----------------------------------------------+
     |     _nwnode   _nwinc~e    faction   cloist~e |
     |----------------------------------------------|
  1. |      Albert          1      Turks      FALSE |
  2. |       Amand          1   Outcasts      FALSE |
  3. |     Ambrose          1      Loyal      FALSE |
  4. |       Basil          1   Outcasts       TRUE |
  5. |    Berthold          1      Loyal      FALSE |
     |----------------------------------------------|
  6. | Bonaventure          1      Loyal       TRUE |
     +----------------------------------------------+

. nwsymmetrize samplike, generate(likes)

. nwsummarize likes
--------------------------------------------------
   Network name:  likes
   Network id:  5
   Directed: false
   Valued: true
   Two-mode: false
   Nodes: 18
   Selfloop: false
   Edges: 60
   Minimum value:  0
   Maximum value:  3
   Density:  .392
   Temporal: false

. 
. * 3. Dense cores: k-cores, cliques and k-plexes
. nwkcore likes, generate(kcore)
(note: tie values are ignored; this measure is binary)
----------------------------------------
  Network name: likes
  Max coreness (degeneracy): 5

      kcore |      Freq.     Percent        Cum.
------------+-----------------------------------
          4 |          4       22.22       22.22
          5 |         14       77.78      100.00
------------+-----------------------------------
      Total |         18      100.00
 

. nwclique likes, generate(clique) minsize(4)
(note: tie values are ignored; this measure is binary)
----------------------------------------
  Network name: likes
  Maximal cliques (size >= 4): 7

    Variable |        Obs        Mean    Std. dev.       Min        Max
-------------+---------------------------------------------------------
      clique |         12    5.083333    .9962049          4          6
 

. nwkplex likes, k(2) generate(plex) minsize(5)
(note: tie values are ignored; this measure is binary)
----------------------------------------
  Network name: likes
  Maximal 2-plexes (size >= 5): 21

    Variable |        Obs        Mean    Std. dev.       Min        Max
-------------+---------------------------------------------------------
        plex |         18    5.722222    .4608886          5          6
 

